    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Waste Time Lotto \u2013 The Odds Are Terrible, but Hope Never Dies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you love games where you can <strong>watch numbers roll in</strong>, hoping that this time, against all odds, you'll hit the jackpot? <strong>Waste Time Lotto</strong> is here just for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf9f\u00a0\u00a0<strong>What\u2019s in store?</strong><br>\u2705 A four-digit lottery that almost never matches!*<br>\u2705 Automated draws at a rapid pace \u2013 because waiting is overrated!<br>\u2705 A never-ending win counter \u2013 no money, just infinite glory and a number that keeps growing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 And while you're waiting... why not press the Useless Click button and enjoy the fully integrated clicker? Totally optional, utterly pointless, oddly satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Feeling lucky? Enter your own lucky number and see if fate is on your side!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc5\u00a0So, what are you waiting for? Come waste some time in the only lottery where the real prize is perseverance!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Approximately 1 to 5 wins every 10 hours</i></p>",
